@startuml
title Exact target-deploy terminality under intermediate LFB progress

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFC
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #29434E
  LifeLineBorderColor #546E7A
  ParticipantBorderColor #37474F
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
}

participant "Integration observer" as O
participant "Node status API" as A
participant "Casper finalizer" as F
participant "Parallel validators" as V

O -> A: exact status(target)
A --> O: Pending; LFB #4
V -> F: support for intermediate floor
F --> A: publish LFB #6
O -> A: exact status(target) + LFB
A --> O: Pending; strict height progress
note right of O
Renew 45s stall budget.
Do not report success.
135s absolute budget is unchanged.
end note
V -> F: later mutual-knowledge support
F --> A: publish target-bearing finalized closure
O -> A: exact status(target)
A --> O: Finalized
note right of O
Success is target-bound.
Same-height churn never renews a budget.
end note
@enduml
